              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ancuk"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used the suggestions from the other users and added pepper, onions. The mixture was really thick, but there was no flavor. This ended up as a very bland dish.",
            "datePublished": "2010-12-19T10:32:12.220Z"
          },
          {
