              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MUTHIG"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I had to eat this without the egg because of allergies but still thought it was good. My husband ate it with the egg and loved it!",
            "datePublished": "2007-08-02T14:29:13.827Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
