            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "noodlaicious"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made the recipe as stated except I added some pepper. Pretty bland. The presentation was not appetizing. I recommend really toasting the bread good, otherwise it gets soggy, and I also recommend NOT using fat free soup, as you'll need the flavor. I don't think I'll make this again.",
